 plus a production cutover plan. It does not perform production Supabase, production storage, RAG/vector, OCR/VLM, external model, or scoring mutations.\n\n## Verdicts\n\n- scoped_alpha: `ready_with_exceptions`\n- full_9709_beta: `blocked`\n- public_launch: `future_authorization_required`\n\nFull beta remains blocked because locator/display scope is incomplete for the full 3530-row universe and failed/blocked visual-QA assets remain visible in the blocker inventory. Public launch remains future authorization required.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-reveal-runtime-final-closeout.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-reveal-launch-rehearsal.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-reveal-runtime-rehearsal.test.js`\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-ms-reveal-runtime-final-closeout.mjs`\n- `npx eslint scripts/method-map/build-post-attempt-ms-reveal-runtime-final-closeout.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/post-attempt-ms-reveal-runtime-final-closeout.test.js`\n- `npm run quality:report-index`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json`","created_at":"2026-07-09T10:13:54Z","updated_at":"2026-07-09T10:32:41Z","closed_at":"2026-07-09T10:32:41Z","merged_at":"2026-07-09T10:32:41Z","merge_commit_sha":"9ecb0250dc7a4cdf52f223289fd6a1d07a8fc439","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1516/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1516/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1516/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/4c36e81b53610c5dcb948c8f5269c6602e0c6806","head":{"label":"